376
00:16:48.173 --> 00:16:49.800
{\an8}Magpakasal kay Zzong Zzong, bilisan mo.

377
00:16:49.883 --> 00:16:51.218
{\an8}Ano ang nagpapatagal sa iyo?

378
00:16:51.301 --> 00:16:53.137
{\an8}Sandali lang.
Gusto kong iwan ang baby ko dito.

379
00:16:53.679 --> 00:16:54.930
{\an8}Ang aking matamis na munting...

380
00:16:55.014 --> 00:16:57.224
{\an8}Good, Hubby. Nabadtrip ka. Halika dito.

381
00:16:57.933 --> 00:17:00.728
{\an8}Maaari kang magpahinga dito.
Babalik agad si Mommy.

382
00:17:02.187 --> 00:17:04.148
{\an8}Nakuha nila ang kanyang katawan sa ilog.

383
00:17:04.231 --> 00:17:06.608
{\an8}Iyan ay magandang gawa ng aming AD.

384
00:17:07.151 --> 00:17:08.527
{\an8}Ay naku.

385
00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:09.611
